<section aria-labelledby="membership-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-bone text-charcoal" id="membership"><div class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-36"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70"><span class="tabular-nums">06</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Membership</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.4rem,5vw,5rem)] font-light leading-[1] tracking-[-0.03em]" id="membership-heading">A club for <em class="font-serif font-normal">the long game.</em></h2></div><div class="self-end lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75" data-reveal="true">Membership is capped at 650 so the course never feels crowded. Tee times run every twelve minutes, the practice ground is yours from first light, and the clubhouse is kept for members and their guests.</p><p class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-charcoal/15 bg-paper px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-charcoal/80" data-reveal="true"><span class="relative flex size-2"><span class="absolute inset-0 animate-ping rounded-full bg-clay/60 motion-reduce:hidden"></span><span class="relative size-2 rounded-full bg-clay"></span></span>Applications open for 2027</p></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand mt-14 aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px] sm:aspect-[16/9] lg:mt-20 lg:aspect-[21/9]" data-mask="center"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="10"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="Two golfers carrying their bags down a fairway toward the bay at sunset" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/campaign/members-walking.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center 42